{"parse": {"title": "在高山下-07", "pageid": 128078, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9C%A8%E9%AB%98%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8B-06\" title=\"在高山下-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">在高山下-07</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">在高山下</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A7.8B.E6.97.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"秋日\">秋日</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 秋日</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Autumn</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">8:00 驻军营地办公室</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">恩伊·哈努古城外，驻军营地办公室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory molideer pic 07.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png/110px-Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png/165px-Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png/220px-Rolestory_molideer_pic_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p>不久之后，一封简短的通信被送到了中尉女士的案头。<br />\n1920.11.11，西线停战。<br />\n你部驻留恩伊·哈努城募兵整备，待后信。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“他们的战争结束了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“但我们的还没有。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>中尉女士推开窗，雪山在日光照映下闪耀如旧。<br />\n远远望去，她能看见新征募的士兵——这座村子的年轻人们——正牵着军马在河边休息。<br />\n她拿起某位分别了的亲人曾送给自己的勋章。<br />\n独一无二的，送给“最好的姐姐”——<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"希望能在东线见到她，当面好好谈谈\">希望能在东线见到她，当面好好谈谈</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"不希望妹妹出现在东线，更不想再次兵戎相见\">不希望妹妹出现在东线，更不想再次兵戎相见</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"希望能在东线见到她，当面好好谈谈\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“也许她会去东线。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“我不知道……或许他们不会再把她派往前线。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“但也说不定，毕竟父亲在那儿。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>中尉女士低声道。<br />\n看着略有些锈迹的勋章，这就像她们之间难以修复的关系。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"不希望妹妹出现在东线，更不想再次兵戎相见\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #bc9567; padding: 0 5px;\"><big><b>您的选择为未来带来了一丝改变</b></big></span></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“她最好不要踏入战场。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“父亲的军队不会对她留情，但愿我们再不要相见。”<br />\n她攥紧了勋章，金属传递着只属于她的温度。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“就这样吧。”<br />\n而后，她带上枪，转身走向户外。她的“牧群”在等待着她。<br />\n秋高气爽，窗外晴空万里，太阳高悬于秋日明净的蓝天之上。<br />\n</p>\n</div></div><br />\n<div style=\"text-align:center; border:1px dotted #bc9567; border-radius:3px; background-color:#bc956720; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><big><b>结局Ⅱ要求：前面的分支关卡中四次选择均导向“分支Ⅰ”（关心洛佩拉的倾向）。<br />如不满足，解锁结局Ⅰ。</b></big></span></div>\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"结局Ⅰ\">结局Ⅰ</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"结局Ⅱ\">结局Ⅱ</div></div>\n<div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"结局Ⅱ\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">圣洛夫基金会·审讯室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p>而在另一边……<br />\n她即将结束这漫长的问讯——最后一场问讯。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“我没别的好说了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“他们是叛徒。‘芝诺的伊戈尔将军’已经‘牺牲’了，我不知道现在领导叛军的是谁。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>审讯官：</b></span>“是你说的那位已经牺牲了的伊戈尔将军，我们很确定。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“那莫莉德尔呢？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>审讯官：</b></span>“我们没有关于她的消息。莫莉德尔下落不明。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>审讯官：</b></span>“你考虑去东线吗，士兵？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>……<br />\n面对提问，她沉默好久，这才慢慢开口。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“我知道你的言下之意。但我是士兵，也愿意踏上战场——无论去哪儿。”<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"结局Ⅰ\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">圣洛夫基金会·办公室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p>而在另一边，一场漫长的调查审讯即将结束。<br />\n一位“不速之客”——一纸来信闯了进来。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会工作人员：</b></span>“抱歉打扰，但有一些消息需要送给洛佩拉小姐。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>基金会工作人员走进屋里，把信封交给洛佩拉。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她拆开、取出，当着旁人的面。她没受到阻拦。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“东线。伊戈尔。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她默默地读着，那些令她不愉快的名字让少女的脸上写满不快。<br />\n她似乎在找寻着另一个名字。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会工作人员：</b></span>“我们觉得把这些消息告诉你比较好。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“谢谢。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会工作人员：</b></span>“我们没有莫莉德尔的消息。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“我不知道姐姐去哪儿了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“如果她还活着，那希望她不会为自己的选择后悔吧。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会工作人员：</b></span>“但愿如此。她在南极似乎为我们做了一些工作。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“是吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“如果有她的消息，我想知道，要是有的话。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会工作人员：</b></span>“好的，我们尽量。”<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>拉开审讯室的百叶窗，光亮刺眼。<br />\n晚秋的午后，阳光斜照进这间冷冰冰的屋子。<br />\n洛佩拉站在窗边，抬手遮挡，眯着眼睛看向外面——<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛佩拉：</b></span>“你先前说‘暴雨’又改变了时代。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>审讯官：</b></span>“是的，我们回到了1920年——距上一次的71年前。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>审讯官：</b></span>“大战还没结束，和我们已知的历史不一样。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>战争仍在继续。<br />\n受审者没有作声。表情复杂地看着遥不可及的远方。<br />\n日光之下，远在世界的另一个角落，她心中挂念着的那位女士正在高山下，紧握着缰绳。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">恩伊·哈努古城外，河谷</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“列队！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>中尉女士的命令铿锵有力。河谷旁，她的士兵整装待发。<br />\n马队训练有素，等待接下来的命令。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>莫莉德尔：</b></span>“前进——！”<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "在高山下-07"}}